        "ratings": [
            {
                "comment": "Pretty good professor for a pretty boring course, generous with grades, gives good feedback, generally cares for his students and is a pretty nice guy overall. He is Colombian though so his accent and arrangement of words are a bit weird sometimes (his vocabulary and writing skills are great though!)",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I really enjoyed his class. It was pretty easy and mostly writing assignments. We do lots of peer reviews, and he gives thorough feedback quickly. He grades generously. Participation is mandatory, but I only spoke a few times and still got an A. Just show up and do the work. He is a nice guy and truly cares about his students.\n",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Oscar is a really funny and interactive professor! I participated in class discussions maybe 7 times and got an A for participation. He is very good at teaching the course content. It is an English class, so get ready to write a lot. He gives very good feedback on writing assignments. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "Overall, the class was a fun time. The Professor was a blast to have and always in a good mood. I would recommend participating in class when he asks questions or thoughts to get a good grade for attendance and participation. He does have a little bit of broken English, but can still understand clearly. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "&#211;scar Useche is a really personable professor. He does a thorough job explaining course content to make sure we understand the content. He also has scheduled meetings to make sure you are understanding the content. He provides helpful feedback on work and is a flexible grader. Would want him as a professor again!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I really enjoyed this class - Oscar is a really nice guy & gives good feedback on the paper assignments & everything you need to do leading up to the final draft. Readings are long & you have to watch a few films, so prepare to spend some time on this. Definitely goes on a tangent sometimes but still super interesting & he's super accommodating. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
